# Pairs with BackupSagaConsistent. A batch committed in d0 is emitted from
# whatever prepares the window holds, with no completeness check and no fall
# back: a batch whose first prepare precedes the base's frontier is restored
# half post-saga.
MODULE: BackupSagaConsistentStraddleEmittedWithoutFallback
TARGET: BackupSagaConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a committed batch is emitted from the prepares the window happens to hold
PERTURBS: Drain

--- FIND
         IF FallsBack
         THEN FullLink(Lens, TRUE)
         ELSE [kind |-> "incr", heads |-> NewHeads, emit |-> Emit,
--- REPLACE
         \* MUTATION: no completeness check and no fall back.
         IF FALSE
         THEN FullLink(Lens, TRUE)
         ELSE [kind |-> "incr", heads |-> NewHeads,
               emit |-> IF ~AbortSeen /\ d0 = "committed" THEN SeenPrep ELSE {},
--- END
